# Complete Pilotwings takeoff flight script extending verified advance tutorial sequence
# Phase 1: Boot to title
wait 220
press start 5

# Phase 2: Title to password prompt
wait 120
press start 5

# Phase 3: Password prompt -> confirm "NO"
wait 200
press a 5
wait 60
press a 5
wait 60
press start 5

# Phase 4: Lesson 1 Briefing (Tony)
wait 200
press a 5
wait 60
press start 5
wait 60
press a 5
wait 60
press start 5

# Phase 5: Event Select -> Select "LIGHT PLANE" with B, then confirm with START
wait 60
press b 5
wait 60
press start 5

# Phase 6: Flight Curriculum / Controls screen 1
wait 120
press start 5
wait 60
press b 5
wait 60
press start 5

# Phase 7: Transition to NOSE DOWN / NOSE UP screen
wait 60
press b 5
wait 60
press start 5
wait 60
press b 5
wait 60
press start 5

# At frame 1730, last button pressed. NOSE DOWN / NOSE UP fades in at ~1960.
# Wait for NOSE DOWN / NOSE UP to appear and stabilize (~frame 2020)
wait 280

# Phase 8: Advance past NOSE DOWN / NOSE UP into the 3D Flight Scene!
press start 5
wait 60
press b 5
wait 60
press start 5
wait 60
press a 5

# Phase 9: 3D Flight Scene (Runway & Flight)
wait 180

# Full throttle (A button) down the runway
press a 180
wait 30

# Pull back stick (DOWN) while holding throttle to take off
press a+down 90
wait 30

# Bank right in mid-air
press a+right 90
wait 60

quit
